Auslander--Buchsbaum gives \(\operatorname{depth}_R Q=1\). Its support is
exactly \(V(z)\); hence its only associated prime is \((z)\). Therefore
\(u\) is a nonzerodivisor on \(Q\), and the finite \(O\)-module \(Q\) is
free.

