other 125 y-series = (597 + 624 + 504)/42 = 1725/42. With
lc_y(f-a) = gamma x^42(1+..): ord_t f_y = 42(-42 + 1725/42) = -39.
(AM-2) requires ord_t f_y = ord_t(dx/dt) - ord_t(dg/dt) = -43 - (-4)
