+
+Therefore
+
+\[
+ \boxed{
+ \kappa_i\to\infty\ \not\Longrightarrow\ \Delta_{P_i}\to\infty}
+ \tag{3.4}
+\]
+
+at the accepted formal residue-A tier, and the implication already fails
