+
+### 5.2 Class-kill: the residual Jacobian curve
+
+For
+
+\[
+ f=x^d+y,qquad g=x^e+y^{e-1},
+ \tag{5.3}
+\]
+
+the general \(f\)-fiber is rational with one branch at infinity and
