+
+\[
+ \boxed{
+ \Delta^{\mathrm{H1}}_{\gamma_i}(r)=3,\qquad
+ \Delta^{\mathrm{H1}}_{\gamma_1}(r)
+ +\Delta^{\mathrm{H1}}_{\gamma_2}(r)=6}
+ \tag{3.2}
+\]
+
+for every \(r\).  If a stage algebraizes to a Keller pair of degree
+\(d_r\), its exact local equations must be
+
