+ \text{intrinsic polar excess}&1&1\\
+ \text{conductor}&\to\infty&\to\infty\\
+ \text{excluded by}&\text{orbit minimality}&\text{pure Jacobian support}
+\end{array}
+\tag{5.6}
+\]
+
+Neither \(\Delta\) nor \(\delta\) by itself excludes both.
+
+---
